            "action_name": {
              "value": "Take Root"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, primal)\n\nRequirements: The corpseroot has a creature grabbed or restrained\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe corpseroot buries its roots into the creature, dealing 1d6+11 piercing damage and draining the target's life force (30 basic Fortitude save). On a failure, the creature is drained 1 (or increases the value by 1 if already drained), and the corpseroot regains 10 HP. If this would make a creature drained 5, the creature dies."
            },
